      "text": "State at 18:03 UTC: The recommendationservice pod online-boutique/recommendationservice-659fd87c86-c7xjn is failing to start with a CrashLoopBackOff… Revert to working 32Mi — apply Option A Increase to 64Mi with headroom — apply Option B  *What's wrong*  State at 18:03 UTC: The recommendationservice pod online-boutique/recommendationservice-659fd87c86-c7xjn is failing to start with a CrashLoopBackOff status due to its server container being repeatedly OOM-killed.  *Why*  • The newly applied deployment revision 3 configures a memory limit of 20Mi, which is insufficient since the active healthy container (from revision 2) uses 30Mi of memory, resulting in immediate container OOMKilled terminations (exit code 137) during startup.  *What to do*  • *Option A (Revert to working 32Mi):* Revert the recommendationservice deployment memory requests and limits to the last-working value of 32Mi. • *Option B (Increase to 64Mi with headroom):* Increase the recommendationservice deployment memory requests and limits to 64Mi to prevent future OOM crashes. • :white_check_mark: *Recommended: Option B* — Increasing the limits to 64Mi provides additional headroom for Python's memory consumption, ensuring a safer and more durable fix than running right at the 30Mi edge. • *To authorize:* reply *'apply'* to open a GitOps Pull Request with the recommended fix, or name one directly with *'apply Option A'* / *'apply Option B'*.  :link: <https://console.cloud.google.com/kubernetes/workload/overview?project=kcna-2026-demos|GKE Workloads> | <https://console.cloud.google.com/logs/query;query=resource.type%3D%22k8s_container%22;project=kcna-2026-demos|Cloud Logs>  *Evidence for verified claims*  The pod recommendationservice-659fd87c86-c7xjn is in CrashLoopBackOff state. (exit 0, 2026-11-02T18:03:41Z)  ``` $ kubectl get pod recommendationservice-659fd87c86-c7xjn -n online-boutique ``` ``` recommendationservice-659fd87c86-c7xjn   0/1     CrashLoopBackOff ```  The container server was terminated because it was OOMKilled with exit code 137. (exit 0, 2026-11-02T18:01:06Z)  ``` $ kubectl get pod recommendationservice-659fd87c86-c7xjn -n online-boutique -o jsonpath='{.status.containerStatuses[0].lastState.terminated.reason}' ``` ``` OOMKilled ```  Revision 3 has limits and requests configured for memory at 20Mi. (exit 0, 2026-11-02T18:00:46Z)  ``` $ kubectl get rs recommendationservice-659fd87c86 -n online-boutique -o yaml ``` ```             memory: 20Mi ```  Revision 2 has limits and requests configured for memory at 32Mi and is running. (exit 0, 2026-11-02T18:04:09Z)  ``` $ kubectl get rs recommendationservice-556b7d9948 -n online-boutique -o yaml ``` ```             memory: 32Mi ```  The running instance of recommendationservice is currently utilizing 30Mi of memory. (exit 0, 2026-11-02T18:04:12Z)  ``` $ kubectl top pod -n online-boutique ``` ``` recommendationservice-556b7d9948-l72m2   10m          30Mi ```",
